UPDATE "Problem" SET "statementText"=E'$\\frac{\\sqrt{12 - x - x^{2}}}{x + 4} \\leq \\frac{\\sqrt{12 - x - x^{2}}}{2x + 3}$ тэнцэтгэл бишийг бод. Бодолт: $\\frac{\\sqrt{12 - x - x^{2}}}{x + 4} \\leq \\frac{\\sqrt{12 - x - x^{2}}}{2x + 3} ⤇ \\frac{\\sqrt{12 - x - x^{2}} \\bullet \\left( x - \\lbrack a\\rbrack \\right)}{(x + 4)(2x + 3)} \\leq 0$ гэж хувиргаж болно. Цааш бодвол $\\left\\lbrack \\begin{array}{r} \\left\\ \\begin{array}{r} 12 - x - x^{2} \\geq 0 \\\\ (x + 4)(2x + 3)\\left( x - \\lbrack a\\rbrack \\right) \\leq 0 \\\\ x \\neq - \\lbrack b\\rbrack; x \\neq - 1.5 \\\\ \\end{array} \\right. \\\\ \\left\\ \\begin{array}{r} 12 - x - x^{2} = 0 \\\\ x \\neq - \\lbrack b\\rbrack; x \\neq - 1.5 \\end{array} \\right. \\end{array} \\right$ ба эндээс тэнцэтгэл бишийн шийд $x \\in \\rbrack - \\frac{\\lbrack c\\rbrack}{\\lbrack d\\rbrack};\\lbrack e\\rbrack\\rbrack \\cup \\{\\lbrack f\\rbrack\\}$ байна. Амжилт хүсье!' WHERE id='cmqdboaje013u407nwajtq1ob';
UPDATE "Problem" SET "statementText"=E'$(a;b) \\neq 1$ ба эерэг бодит тоо; $a^{4} = \\sqrt[3]{b}$ бол $\\log_{a}\\left( b \\bullet a^{3} \\right) -$ ийн утгыг ол.' WHERE id='cmqdbobsh01s6407n5zk6f1oc';
