UPDATE "Problem" SET "statementText"=E'$\\frac{\\sqrt{6 + x - x^{2}}}{x + 2} \\leq \\frac{\\sqrt{6 + x - x^{2}}}{2x + 1}$ тэнцэтгэл бишийг бод. Бодолт: $\\frac{\\sqrt{6 + x - x^{2}}}{x + 2} \\leq \\frac{\\sqrt{6 + x - x^{2}}}{2x + 1} ⤇ \\frac{\\sqrt{6 + x - x^{2}} \\bullet \\left( x - \\lbrack a\\rbrack \\right)}{(x + 2)(2x + 1)} \\leq 0$ гэж хувиргаж болно. Цааш бодвол $\\left\\lbrack \\begin{array}{r} \\left\\ \\begin{array}{r} 6 + x - x^{2} \\geq 0 \\\\ (x + 2)(2x + 1)\\left( x - \\lbrack a\\rbrack \\right) \\leq 0 \\\\ x \\neq - \\lbrack b\\rbrack; x \\neq - 0.5 \\\\ \\end{array} \\right. \\\\ \\left\\ \\begin{array}{r} 6 + x - x^{2} = 0 \\\\ x \\neq - \\lbrack b\\rbrack; x \\neq - 0.5 \\end{array} \\right. \\end{array} \\right$ ба эндээс тэнцэтгэл бишийн шийд $x \\in \\rbrack - \\frac{\\lbrack c\\rbrack}{\\lbrack d\\rbrack};\\lbrack e\\rbrack\\rbrack \\cup \\{\\lbrack f\\rbrack\\}$ байна.' WHERE id='cmqdboali014p407nm7ostbxj';
UPDATE "Problem" SET "statementText"=E'$\\log_{a}x=6,\\log_{a}y = 4$ бол $\\log_{a}\\frac{\\sqrt{x}}{y^{3}},\\log_{a}{x^{2} \\bullet \\sqrt{y}} -$ ийн утгыг ол. $I.\\log_{a}\\frac{\\sqrt{x}}{y^{3}} = \\log_{a}{\\sqrt{x} - \\log_{a}y^{3}} = \\frac{1}{\\lbrack a\\rbrack}\\log_{a}x - \\lbrack b\\rbrack\\log_{a}y = \\lbrack cd\\rbrack II.\\log_{a}{x^{2} \\bullet \\sqrt{y}} = \\log_{a}x^{2} + \\log_{a}\\sqrt{y} = \\lbrack e\\rbrack\\log_{a}x + \\frac{1}{\\lbrack f\\rbrack}\\log_{a}y = 1\\lbrack g\\rbrack$ байна.' WHERE id='cmqdbobu201t2407ntdjaf4ha';
