UPDATE "Problem" SET "statementText"=E'$\\int_{}^{} x^{3}\\sqrt{x^{2} + 2}dx$ интегралыг бодъё. $u = x^{2} + 2$ гэсэн орлуулга хийвэл $du = \\lbrack a\\rbrack xdx$ болох ба $\\int_{}^{}{x^{3}\\sqrt{x^{2} + 2}dx = \\int_{}^{}{x \\bullet x^{2} \\bullet \\sqrt{x^{2} + 2}dx = \\int_{}^{}{x(u - 2)\\sqrt{u}dx =}}}\\int_{}^{}{(u - 2) \\bullet \\sqrt{u} \\bullet \\frac{du}{\\lbrack a\\rbrack}} = = \\frac{1}{\\lbrack a\\rbrack}\\int_{}^{}{(u - 2) \\bullet u^{\\frac{1}{\\lbrack b\\rbrack}}du = \\frac{1}{\\lbrack a\\rbrack}\\int_{}^{}{\\left( u^{\\frac{\\lbrack c\\rbrack}{\\lbrack b\\rbrack}} - 2 u^{\\frac{1}{\\lbrack b\\rbrack}} \\right)du = \\frac{1}{\\lbrack a\\rbrack}\\left( \\frac{2u^{\\frac{\\lbrack d\\rbrack}{\\lbrack b\\rbrack}}}{\\lbrack e\\rbrack} - \\frac{4u^{\\frac{\\lbrack f\\rbrack}{\\lbrack b\\rbrack}}}{\\lbrack g\\rbrack} \\right) + C =}} \\frac{\\left( x^{2} + 2 \\right)^{\\frac{\\lbrack d\\rbrack}{\\lbrack b\\rbrack}}}{\\lbrack e\\rbrack} - \\frac{2\\left( x^{2} + 2 \\right)^{\\frac{\\lbrack f\\rbrack}{\\lbrack b\\rbrack}}}{\\lbrack g\\rbrack} + C$ Амжилт хүсье!' WHERE id='cmradnew401n3iz7nm4z22dac';
