UPDATE "Problem" SET "statementText"=E'$\\int_{}^{} x^{5}\\sqrt{x^{3} + 1}dx$ интегралыг бодъё. $u = x^{3} + 1$ гэсэн орлуулга хийвэл $du = \\lbrack a\\rbrack x^{2}dx$ болох ба $\\int_{}^{}{x^{5}\\sqrt{x^{3} + 1}dx = \\int_{}^{}{x^{3} \\bullet x^{2} \\bullet \\sqrt{x^{3} + 1}dx = \\int_{}^{}{x^{2}(u - 1)\\sqrt{u}dx =}}}\\int_{}^{}{(u - 1) \\bullet \\sqrt{u} \\bullet \\frac{du}{\\lbrack a\\rbrack}} = = \\frac{1}{\\lbrack a\\rbrack}\\int_{}^{}{(u - 1) \\bullet u^{\\frac{1}{\\lbrack b\\rbrack}}du = \\frac{1}{\\lbrack a\\rbrack}\\int_{}^{}{\\left( u^{\\frac{\\lbrack c\\rbrack}{\\lbrack b\\rbrack}} - u^{\\frac{1}{\\lbrack b\\rbrack}} \\right)du = \\frac{1}{\\lbrack a\\rbrack}\\left( \\frac{2u^{\\frac{\\lbrack d\\rbrack}{\\lbrack b\\rbrack}}}{\\lbrack e\\rbrack} - \\frac{2u^{\\frac{\\lbrack f\\rbrack}{\\lbrack b\\rbrack}}}{\\lbrack g\\rbrack} \\right) + C =}} \\frac{1}{\\lbrack a\\rbrack} \\left( \\frac{\\left( x^{3} + 1 \\right)^{\\frac{\\lbrack d\\rbrack}{\\lbrack b\\rbrack}}}{\\lbrack e\\rbrack} - \\frac{\\left( x^{3} + 1 \\right)^{\\frac{\\lbrack f\\rbrack}{\\lbrack b\\rbrack}}}{\\lbrack g\\rbrack} \\right) + C$' WHERE id='cmradnews01ohiz7ndhip5c76';
